  "content_case_mfg_leads_story_1": "**First pilot**: “Full-auto outbound” as the first scenario. After 4 weeks, sales pushed back — uncontrolled scripts, poor CX, unclear attribution. IT raised compliance concerns; pilot stopped.",
  "@content_case_mfg_leads_story_1": {
    "description": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.1",
