    "description": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.3",
    "x-blockhub-key": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.3"
  },
  "content_case_mfg_leads_story_4": "**Shareable pack**: Case detail and [one-pager](/downloads/one-pager-mfg.pdf) on [Cases](/cases); peers can browse [Manufacturing solutions](/industry/mfg).",
  "@content_case_mfg_leads_story_4": {
    "description": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.4",
    "x-blockhub-key": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.4"
  },
  "content_case_mfg_leads_story_5": "**Lesson**: Keep a [human-confirm path](/trust/security-faq) for the first scenario; agree metrics in writing — honest pivots pass internal review better than “full auto” hype.",
